# C-022 BVFS: real catalog queries. Every case that reads the cache first runs
# ".bvfs_update jobid=1" (idempotent cache population) so the result does not
# depend on which Director ran first. .bvfs_cleanup, .bvfs_clear_cache yes and
# .bvfs_restore modify the catalog and are only covered by unit tests.
